This adapter preserves the official two-stage music-to-dance inference path.
The Vonk-specific adaptation pins all model paths to the mounted immutable
snapshot, disables runtime downloads and sequence parallelism for one DGX
Spark, validates the job contract, and publishes the final MP4 artifact.
